---
source: crates/core/tests/arch.rs
expression: everything
---
Bootcraft plan for Arch Linux (15 tasks)

[1/15] Colorful pacman output  (arch.pacman-tweaks)
    $ edit /etc/pacman.conf: enable Color in [options]
    $ edit /etc/pacman.conf: enable ILoveCandy in [options]

[2/15] Enable the multilib repository  (arch.multilib)
    $ edit /etc/pacman.conf: enable the [multilib] repository

[3/15] Update the system  (system.update)
    $ pacman -Syu --noconfirm

[4/15] Build tools (base-devel, git)  (arch.build-tools)
    $ pacman -S --needed --noconfirm base-devel git

[5/15] AUR helper (yay)  (arch.aur-helper)
    $ build from the AUR as your user, then pacman -U: yay-bin  (skipped if yay, paru or pikaur is already installed)

[6/15] Flatpak with Flathub  (flatpak.flathub)
    $ pacman -S --needed --noconfirm flatpak
    $ flatpak remote-add --if-not-exists --system flathub https://dl.flathub.org/repo/flathub.flatpakrepo

[7/15] Media codecs and thumbnails  (media.codecs)
    $ pacman -S --needed --noconfirm gst-libav gst-plugins-base gst-plugins-good gst-plugins-bad gst-plugins-ugly gst-plugin-va ffmpegthumbnailer

[8/15] Archive tools  (tools.archive)
    $ pacman -S --needed --noconfirm tar gzip zip unzip 7zip unrar

[9/15] NTFS and exFAT drives  (tools.drives)
    $ pacman -S --needed --noconfirm ntfs-3g exfatprogs

[10/15] Fonts for every language and emoji  (system.fonts)
    $ pacman -S --needed --noconfirm noto-fonts noto-fonts-cjk noto-fonts-emoji

[11/15] Microsoft core fonts  (system.ms-fonts)
    $ build from the AUR as your user, then pacman -U: ttf-ms-fonts

[12/15] Firmware updates  (system.firmware)
    $ pacman -S --needed --noconfirm fwupd

[13/15] Linux Mint look for Cinnamon  (desktop.cinnamon-mint)
    $ pacman -S --needed --noconfirm ristretto papers gedit gnome-calculator papirus-icon-theme file-roller nemo-fileroller
    $ pacman -Rns --noconfirm engrampa (installed ones only)
    $ build from the AUR as your user, then pacman -U: mint-artwork
    $ edit /etc/lightdm/lightdm.conf: set greeter-session=lightdm-slick-greeter in [Seat:*] (if the file exists)

[14/15] Firewall (ufw)  (system.firewall)
    $ pacman -S --needed --noconfirm ufw
    $ ufw default deny incoming
    $ ufw default allow outgoing
    $ ufw allow 22/tcp
    $ ufw --force enable
    $ systemctl enable --now ufw.service

[15/15] Remove LibreOffice  (debloat.libreoffice)
    $ pacman -Rns --noconfirm libreoffice* (installed ones only)
